  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving maternal mental health in South East Asia through assets based approaches.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCRF Global Maternal and Neo award to improve the mental health and wellbeing of mothers, infants and families in South East Asia, through improvement in detection, assessment and treatment of perinatal mental illness.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
